lines=['# Exact-cut V4: recorded queue-wait diagnosis','','This is a read-only analysis of the four complete 500/s raw archives from artifact `65c41d519ea78af9ba14d8b4a878adefc2cc388f6682f4ae6dea513351e40e69`, source `0c8303b2`. It executes no orders and changes no benchmark input or result. Each arm has 10,000 accepted one-unit trades. The slowest 1% means the 100 largest scheduled-arrival-to-reply intervals in that arm.','','| Arm | Fraction of tail queue wait overlapping forbidden business-admission phases | Tail wait overlapping a previous request from the same producer |','| --- | --- | --- |']
